						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 3: VIDEO OSCILLATOR\n\nThe Texture from Data node is the essential building block for video synthesis as it allows you to convert numbers into pixels.\nIn this example we create two video oscillators by using the Perlin Generator nodes.\nThese oscillators are then used to pull and push each other using the UV-Offset node and mixed using the Transition node."
